{"chapter-slug":"rw5-56 G","paragraph":268,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-quote":"They’ve killed [Commander] Geim, [Commander] Helica, and [Knight Commander] Sir Meilmen!","id":"1cf3b420-dd22-5624-862e-eb8cbab08f16"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-21 KQ","paragraph":529,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-slug":"knight-commander-calirn","holder-quote":"But today? He just stood here. Reflecting on his faults that had led to Ser Raim and the [Hunters]’ deaths. For he was Knight-Commander Calirn. He was responsible for leading his order to war. For making decisions that would lead to the death of his [Knights].","id":"c5f756d9-f7ca-56e2-9859-f24af281ae41"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-21 KQ","paragraph":572,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-slug":"knight-commander-calirn","holder-quote":"The [Knight Commander] himself winced; the Thronebearers actually took lessons in flowery language along with actual combat training.","id":"8d5020d0-a4e4-5fed-9213-fb76cf471b42"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-21 KQ","paragraph":578,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-slug":"knight-commander-calirn","holder-quote":"Dalimont bowed again to the [Knight Commander], a grandmaster.","id":"ac92f79c-db8a-596e-8df2-652935f83db4"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-21 KQ","paragraph":667,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-slug":"knight-commander-calirn","holder-quote":"The [Knight Commander] was about to ask Dalimont more, push for more information before the barge arrived—when he heard a roar in the distance.","id":"79632460-9b26-5df4-a178-058e6140c4e5"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-21 KQ","paragraph":825,"wording":"[Knight Commander]","event":"named","holder-slug":"knight-commander-calirn","holder-quote":"And now—the funeral barge was incoming. And the music was still playing. The [Knight Commander] closed his eyes.","id":"3afe6527-ebea-56ce-a506-27b7312e019a"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-58","paragraph":1390,"wording":"[Knight-Commander]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Knight-Commander Calirn looked up.","id":"9caf90a1-3df6-5793-a785-9676c4d062ef"}
